  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have been working on a user-friendly component that automatically generates FX layers from user configuration of face blendshapes and objects to toggle on their avatar. It would be helpful if I could attach a component to the avatar in the scene that isn't included in the build to store/manipulate these configurations. I thought this could be accomplished using the EditorOnly tag on a child GameObject under the avatar.\nSince it has the EditorOnly tag it wouldn't be included in the final build but the SDK avatar ValidationUtils still disallows it (and there is no option to ignore this warning).\nCan you please change ValidationUtils.FindIllegalComponents to ignore components where the parent game object has the tag EditorOnly? Thanks!",
